LOAN APP PROJECT: TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION
Project: Loan/Lease app 
General description: A web Application were borrowers can obtain loans, investors can give out loan. (P2P lending platform)
App Name: Loan@
Type: monolithic app
Tools/Tech Stack: ReactJs , Axios, JavaSpringboot, MySQL, Payment gateway
Actors: Guest, Users, Admin, SuperAdmin
Use cases: {
Client_User: 
•	login/logout
•	manage profile
•	Request a loan
•	See his loan requests
•	see my active loans
•	see past loans
•	make loan payment
•	view my transaction history
•	raise a dispute
Investor_User: 
•	login/logout
•	manage profile
•	view loan request list
•	Match a loan request
•	see active loans
•	Make Investment deposits
•	view  my transaction history
•	raise a dispute



Guest_User:
•	view landing page
•	register account
•	view about page

Admin: 
•	Login
•	Manage user account
•	See all loan request
•	See transactions
•	Make Funds Disbursement
•	Resolve disputes
•	Manage Platform settings
SuperAdmin: 
•	All Admin roles +
•	Assign roles and permissions 
•	See all the activity log on the platform
•	Change platform settings
}














